column2:
Therefore, O lord of birds, that is not real for Brahma and Vayu; the state called sleep is like the state of dreaming;
garudpurana:299:29	understand from me that it exists in Brahma only in a secondary sense. So this should not be accepted as real, O lord of birds.
garudpurana:299:30	For those who know the reality, austerity is their constant wealth. Shri Garuda said: "Since sleep is an effect of ignorance, it is said that there is no sleep [for him].
